### Phase 8: role-based authorization through the gateway.
### Tokens:  ./infrastructure/keycloak/pkce-login.sh <alice|bob|sam|ada> 2>/dev/null

@gw = http://localhost:8080
@alice = paste-alice-token
@bob = paste-bob-token
@sam = paste-sam-token
@ada = paste-ada-token
@aliceId = 7f3c9a2e-1b4d-4e8a-9c6f-2d5b8e1a0f3c
@accountId = paste-an-alice-account-id

### ---------- CUSTOMER self-service ----------

### Alice's profile (404 = not created yet)
GET {{gw}}/api/customers/me
Authorization: Bearer {{alice}}

### Create it (identity comes from the token; any keycloakUserId in the body is ignored)
POST {{gw}}/api/customers/me
Authorization: Bearer {{alice}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "firstName": "Alice", "lastName": "Customer", "email": "alice@example.com", "phoneNumber": "+66 81 234 5678",
  "address": { "street": "1 Silom Rd", "city": "Bangkok", "postalCode": "10500", "country": "TH" } }

### Alice's accounts (no ownerId parameter any more)
GET {{gw}}/api/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{alice}}

### Open an account for herself
POST {{gw}}/api/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{alice}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "type": "SAVINGS", "currency": "THB" }

### Deposit into her own account
POST {{gw}}/api/accounts/{{accountId}}/deposit
Authorization: Bearer {{alice}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": 100.00 }

### ---------- attacks (all must fail) ----------

### Bob reads Alice's account → 404 (indistinguishable from "doesn't exist")
GET {{gw}}/api/accounts/{{accountId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{bob}}

### Bob withdraws from Alice's account → 404
POST {{gw}}/api/accounts/{{accountId}}/withdraw
Authorization: Bearer {{bob}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": 50.00 }

### Sam (SUPPORT) withdraws → 403
POST {{gw}}/api/accounts/{{accountId}}/withdraw
Authorization: Bearer {{sam}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": 50.00 }

### Alice opens the back office → 403
GET {{gw}}/api/admin/customers
Authorization: Bearer {{alice}}

### ---------- back office ----------

### Sam (SUPPORT) lists customers → 200
GET {{gw}}/api/admin/customers?page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{sam}}

### Sam (SUPPORT) views Alice's accounts → 200
GET {{gw}}/api/admin/accounts?ownerId={{aliceId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{sam}}

### Sam (SUPPORT) freezes an account → 403 (read-only role)
PATCH {{gw}}/api/admin/accounts/{{accountId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{sam}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "FROZEN", "reason": "test" }

### Ada (ADMIN) freezes the account → 200; Alice's withdrawals now give 422 ACCOUNT_NOT_ACTIVE
PATCH {{gw}}/api/admin/accounts/{{accountId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{ada}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "FROZEN", "reason": "Suspicious activity reported by phone" }

### Ada (ADMIN) unfreezes
PATCH {{gw}}/api/admin/accounts/{{accountId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{ada}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "ACTIVE", "reason": "Investigation closed" }
